comdlg32: Return the folder view from IServiceProvider::QueryService.

Backport of Wine merge request !10193 by pan hui, merged upstream on
2026-03-05, for Wine 11.0 based runners that predate it. Code and test are
unchanged from the merge request.

Without it, asking the common item dialog's service provider for
IFolderView or IFolderView2 fails with E_NOTIMPL, so a program cannot reach
the shell view that holds the user's selection. Shown by repro/p5b-dialog-com
on Windows 10 (19045) and Wine 11.0.

diff --git a/dlls/comdlg32/tests/itemdlg.c b/dlls/comdlg32/tests/itemdlg.c
